@page "/AboutUs"
<PageTitle>About Us</PageTitle>

<div class="about-page">
    <h1><strong> About Digital Store </strong></h1>

    <br />
    <br />

    <h5><strong>DigitalStore</strong> is a modern online shop created to meet the growing demand for premium digital devices and accessories. Our project began as a vision from a team of passionate tech enthusiasts and software developers who wanted to create a platform where people could buy cutting-edge products with full confidence and outstanding service.

    <p>Our store focuses on selling high-end digital products including:</p>

    <ul>
        <li>Apple iPhones – the latest models with innovative features</li>
        <li>Apple iPads – perfect for work, creativity, and entertainment</li>
        <li>MacBooks – powerful laptops for professionals and students</li>
        <li>Apple Watches and accessories</li>
        <li>High-end digital accessories and gadgets</li>
    </ul>

    <p>The development of DigitalStore was powered by advanced technologies: we use an integrated <strong>Blazor front-end</strong>, a secure <strong>ASP.NET Core API backend</strong>, and a robust <strong>SQL database</strong> to manage products, orders, and customer data. This structure guarantees stability, performance, and security for all users.</p>

    <br />
    <br />

    <h2>Our Mission</h2>

    <br />

    <p>At DigitalStore, our mission is simple: to provide you with a trusted place to purchase the digital devices you love. We believe that technology should be accessible, reliable, and enjoyable.</p>

    <br />

    <h2>Why Shop With Us?</h2>

    <br />

    <table class="about-table">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Key Feature</th>
                <th>What It Means for You</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td>Authenticity</td>
                <td>We guarantee 100% original and certified products.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Customer Support</td>
                <td>24/7 assistance for any question or concern.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Secure Shopping</td>
                <td>Advanced encryption and privacy measures protect your data.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Fast Shipping</td>
                <td>We deliver quickly and safely worldwide.</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Exclusive Deals</td>
                <td>Regular promotions on the latest tech gadgets.</td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <br />

    <h2>Our Vision for the Future</h2>

    <br />
    <br />

    <p>We are continually growing and expanding our digital catalog. Our roadmap includes:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Launching mobile apps for an even smoother shopping experience</li>
        <li>Expanding product categories to include smart home devices and gaming equipment</li>
        <li>Partnering with leading brands to offer exclusive products</li>
    </ul>

    <p>We are proud of the community we have built around technology and innovation. Thank you for trusting DigitalStore and for being part of our journey.</p>

    <p><em>Explore. Discover. Upgrade. Welcome to DigitalStore.</em></p></h5>
</div>

